  "prompt": "Which stores sold more than 1,300 units in December 2024? Use the sales table and count only order lines dated from 1 December 2024 to 31 December 2024, both days included. Return two columns, in this order: store_code and units_sold, the sum of units over those lines. Return one row per store, and only the stores whose December total is above 1,300; the webshop, WEB-01, counts as a store. Order lines with missing units add nothing to the total. Any row order is fine.",
